    "logicalAllowance": 4096,
    "source": "One DFS visit for source leaf_count including its 4096-visit,16-depth,16-leaf limits. Field declaration location and scoped cursor reconstruction reuse existing bounded children; each name comparison examines <=64 bytes. Path/project advance preceding siblings, child leaf-count walks, selected hops and lookahead independently, retaining their distinct ordinal/offset checks.",
    "nominal": "Nominal lookup drains existing record_location_work; declaration_limit drains struct_layout_work with its original diagnostic mapping and byte cap.",
    "initializer": "Caller-owned Initializer and lexer advance at original mutation points: one enter/close/parent increment, field lookup or token stage. Member shorthand and initializer error prefixes are preserved. Advance/constructor raw loops remain independent oracles.",
    "copy": "Parent aggregate_copy_source_work delegates explicit read request 2; pending advances do not charge or mutate and resume consumes each child result once. record_read_source_work reuses output_record_metadata_work and struct_layout_work to authenticate the whole catalog and flatten tags before checking id/leaf, emitting SREAD and assigning its tag. Catalog errors retain kind 5 at offset 0 before operand errors. Source leaf_count remains limited to16 while internal read metadata retains128 leaves. Every read revalidates the pinned catalog as before; no cross-read cache is claimed.",
    "ownership": "No SDK heap class or Bank/Pratt field added. State setup is inline; owning adapters still drain synchronously. No public Pending compiler or measured CPU/time/physical-heap/stack improvement."
  },
